{"1490670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHOOTING STAR", "steam_appid": 1490670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Let's keep it as simple as possible.<br>This is a cross-sectional arcade action game, if you are familiar with such games, please skip this introduction, directly enjoy the game.<br>In the game you can play different heroes, through fierce fighting, shooting, using organs and other means to defeat the enemies:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/ca21073e0a7f9cd0faf87c28d46866e4.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>The game has a COMBO system: extra rewards for your smooth and consistent strike count:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/e8db4e4115fccd832e8cd33eb7ddde58.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>You can use weapons to attack enemies:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/e71ae516e717ceaab05b802d80f2c6c2.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Including poison guns, laser guns, meteor hammers and so on, there are dozens of weapons to choose from.<br>Some heroes don't need to use weapons anymore because of their individual skills:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/59986dc0ab7d0c8f8f7401c76ff02195.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Some heroes have their own weapons:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/f587b02dadb808bae527dea0cca87a14.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Once you're done with the main level, you can challenge Survival Mode. Survival mode ratings are key to unlocking superheroes.<br>The difficulty of the game will be dynamically adjusted as you perform during the game, and it's not that easy to achieve perfect, fluid battles.<br>What are you waiting for? Come and challenge!", "about_the_game": "Let's keep it as simple as possible.<br>This is a cross-sectional arcade action game, if you are familiar with such games, please skip this introduction, directly enjoy the game.<br>In the game you can play different heroes, through fierce fighting, shooting, using organs and other means to defeat the enemies:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/ca21073e0a7f9cd0faf87c28d46866e4.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>The game has a COMBO system: extra rewards for your smooth and consistent strike count:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/e8db4e4115fccd832e8cd33eb7ddde58.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>You can use weapons to attack enemies:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/e71ae516e717ceaab05b802d80f2c6c2.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Including poison guns, laser guns, meteor hammers and so on, there are dozens of weapons to choose from.<br>Some heroes don't need to use weapons anymore because of their individual skills:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/59986dc0ab7d0c8f8f7401c76ff02195.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Some heroes have their own weapons:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/extras/f587b02dadb808bae527dea0cca87a14.avif?t=1608743211\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Once you're done with the main level, you can challenge Survival Mode. Survival mode ratings are key to unlocking superheroes.<br>The difficulty of the game will be dynamically adjusted as you perform during the game, and it's not that easy to achieve perfect, fluid battles.<br>What are you waiting for? Come and challenge!", "short_description": "Arcade cross-sectional action type game. Use martial arts to strike enemies, including four-way walking runningand jumping with common and special skills. Use cold and hot weapons to strike the enemy. Random rewards, intense and compact rhythms. Vintage music type customization.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/header.jpg?t=1608743211", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1608743211", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1608743211", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIN7,10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Performance is greater than or equal to I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 760 OR AMD Radeon™ R7 260x（VRAM MORE 2GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound(DirectX® 9.0 OR MORE)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The windowed/full-screen mode can be switched seamlessly.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><